<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Wednesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	 6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America    13.60 /13.10  14.10 /13.60   14.125/13.40</p>
<p>BPI		    13.50 /13.10  14.00 /13.70   14.375/14.00</p>
<p>Citibank	     13.50 /13.15  13.875/13.625  14.375/14.125</p>
<p>Hongkong Bank	13.625/13.10  14.25 /13.75   14.50 /13.90</p>
<p>Metrobank	    13.75 /13.20  13.975/13.70   14.20 /13.10</p>
<p>Multinational	13.50 /13.00  13.875/13.70   14.00 /13.90</p>
<p>StanChart	    13.50 /13.10  14.25 /13.75   14.50 /13.50</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
